crpf:NativeHawaiianOrPacificIslander rdf:type owl:Class ;
                    rdfs:subClassOf crpf:Race ;
                    rdfs:comment "A person having origins in any of the original peoples of Hawaii, Guam, Samoa, or other Pacific Islands." .


